@startuml
!include theme.iuml
title AnimeLab — classes du domaine et persistance actuelle
top to bottom direction
' @source animelab/models/anime.py:AnimeDetail
' @source animelab/models/anime.py:AnimeResult
' @source animelab/models/anime.py:Episode
' @source animelab/models/download_task.py:DownloadTask
' @source animelab/models/download_task.py:DownloadTaskEntity.to_task
' @source animelab/models/download_task.py:SpeedTracker
' @source animelab/models/download_task.py:DownloadStatus
' @source animelab/models/download_task.py:ExportStatus
' @source animelab/models/auto_download.py:AutoDownloadEpisode
' @source animelab/models/favorite.py:FavoriteAnime
' @source animelab/models/watch_progress.py:WatchProgress
' @source animelab/models/playback.py:PlaybackProgress
package "DTO Pydantic — catalogue" {
  class AnimeResult {
    id: str
    title: str
    url: str
    source: str
    version: str
    genres: List[str]
  }
  class AnimeDetail {
    title: str
    url: str
    source: str
    version: str
    tmdbId: Optional[int]
    episodes: List[Episode]
  }
  class Episode {
    number: int
    title: str
    version: str
    playerUrl: str
    downloadPageUrl: str
    directDownloadUrl: Optional[str]
    subtitleUrl: Optional[str]
  }
  AnimeDetail "1" *-- "0..*" Episode : episodes
  AnimeResult ..> AnimeDetail : ouverture de la fiche\n(pas un héritage)
}
package "Tâches en mémoire" {
  class DownloadTask {
    id: str
    animeName: str
    animeUrl: str
    episodeNumber: int
    version: str
    source: str
    status: DownloadStatus
    exportStatus: ExportStatus
    exportUrisJson: str
    exportDestination: Optional[str]
    exportError: Optional[str]
    exportAttempts: int
    exportedAt: Optional[datetime]
    phase: str
    savePath: Optional[str]
    subtitlesJson: str
    downloadedBytes: int
    totalBytes: int
    paused: bool
    cancelled: bool
    +to_dict(): dict
  }
  class SpeedTracker {
    window_seconds: float
    samples: Deque
    +add_sample(current_bytes, now): int
    +get_speed(now): int
    +reset()
  }
  enum DownloadStatus {
    PENDING
    SCHEDULED
    DOWNLOADING
    RETRYING
    PAUSED
    VERIFICATION_REQUIRED
    MUXING
    COMPLETED
    FAILED
    CANCELLED
  }
  DownloadTask "1" *-- "1" SpeedTracker : speed_tracker
  DownloadTask --> DownloadStatus
  enum ExportStatus {
    NOT_REQUESTED
    PENDING
    EXPORTING
    EXPORTED
    EXPORT_FAILED
  }
  DownloadTask --> ExportStatus
}
package "Entités SQLAlchemy — SQLite" {
  class DownloadTaskEntity <<table download_tasks>> {
    id: PK UUID
    source: str
    version: str
    status: str
    savePath: str
    verificationStatus: str
    exportStatus / exportUrisJson / exportDestination
    exportError / exportAttempts / exportedAt
    +to_task(): DownloadTask
  }
  class FavoriteAnime <<table favorites>> {
    id: PK int
    url: UNIQUE str
    source: str
    lastKnownEpisode: int
    autoDownload: bool
    autoDownloadVersion: str
    autoDownloadSubtitles: bool
    autoDownloadServer / autoDownloadQuality
    autoDownloadInitialized: bool
    autoDownloadError: Optional[str]
    +to_dict(): dict
  }
  class AutoDownloadEpisode <<table auto_download_episodes>> {
    id: PK int
    source / animeUrl / episodeNumber / version: UNIQUE
    episodeUrl: str
    state: str
    taskId: Optional[str]
    discoveredAt: datetime
  }
  FavoriteAnime .. AutoDownloadEpisode : source + URL
  AutoDownloadEpisode .. DownloadTaskEntity : taskId (lien logique)
  class WatchProgress <<table watch_progress>> {
    id: PK int
    animeUrl: str
    episodeNumber: int
    version: str
    downloaded: bool
    watched: bool
    +to_dict(): dict
  }
  DownloadTaskEntity ..> DownloadTask : conversion par to_task()
  FavoriteAnime .. WatchProgress : rapprochement logique par URL
  DownloadTaskEntity .. WatchProgress : URL + épisode + version
}
Episode ..> DownloadTask : crée une tâche pour\nla version sélectionnée
note bottom of WatchProgress
UNIQUE(animeUrl, episodeNumber, version).
Les pointillés entre tables représentent des
rapprochements applicatifs, sans clé étrangère.
end note
note bottom of DownloadTaskEntity
Ne pas confondre le DTO mutable DownloadTask
et son instantané persistant DownloadTaskEntity.
Les attributs sont une sélection, pas l'inventaire complet.
end note
class Migration <<dataclass>> {
  version: int
  name: str
  +apply(connection)
}
class "schema_migrations" as MigrationHistory <<table SQLite>> {
  version: PK int
  name: str
  applied_at: timestamp
}
Migration ..> MigrationHistory : applique puis enregistre\ndans la même transaction
note bottom of MigrationHistory
BEGIN IMMEDIATE ; retour arrière DDL + données sur échec.
Transactions ORM : tâche, progression, export et suivi.
Connexions partagées : WAL, busy_timeout, foreign_keys.
end note
' @source animelab/migrations.py:Migration
' @source animelab/migrations.py:migrate
' @source animelab/database.py:transaction
' @source animelab/database.py:sqlite_connection
class PlaybackProgress <<table>> {
  source: str
  animeUrl: str
  episodeNumber: int
  version: str
  positionSeconds: float
  durationSeconds: float
  selectionJson: str
  sessionId: str
  lastSequence: int
  updatedAt: datetime
}
note right of PlaybackProgress
UNIQUE(source, animeUrl, episodeNumber, version)
Position indépendante des marques WatchProgress.
end note
@enduml
